  caseSubject: Our Family Attic
  caseBody: 'The Case:

    We live in the area currently affected by the strange
    happenings. We took a family photo in the attic and noticed this unsettling mass
    of complete darkness inside our open wardrobe. It was not visible when we took
    the picture. We are frightened and need you to investigate this residual blackness.'
